<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>命令 on tools</title><link>https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/</link><description>Recent content in 命令 on tools</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 23:02:37 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>操作帮助</title><link>https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/help/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 10:51:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/help/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="--help命令选项">&lt;code>--help&lt;/code>命令选项&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#--help%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4%e9%80%89%e9%a1%b9" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>​	大多数命令提供了 &lt;code>--help&lt;/code> 选项来显示简明的帮助信息。这通常比 &lt;code>man&lt;/code> 页面短且更直观。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	使用方法：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#58626f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&amp;lt;命令名&amp;gt; --help
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>例如:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#58626f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ls --help
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="man命令">man命令&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#man%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="man-cmd_name">man cmd_name&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#man-cmd_name" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>​	&lt;code>man&lt;/code> 命令用于查看命令的手册页，它提供了关于某个命令的详细文档，包括用途、选项和用法示例。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>系统和网络安全</title><link>https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/systemSecurityM/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 08:41:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/tools/ubuntu/cmd/systemSecurityM/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="systemctl">systemctl&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#systemctl" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
